      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Back on the sidelines of Studio 2, production manager Sergio starts his phone call with the network sounding tough about Corinna's age, then folds completely within ten seconds. Meanwhile, Rene apologises to Alessandro and points out an influential newspaper critic watching the chaos. Listen to the Italian scene first without worrying about catching every detail.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "sergio",
      "t": "Pronto? Qualcuno ha fatto un grosso errore.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "sergio",
      "t": "Questa deve dire che ha trentaquattro anni, punto e basta.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "rene",
      "t": "Che ha detto Duccio?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "alessandro",
      "t": "Non l'ho trovato.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
